Package: FullPixelMSIQuant
Type: Package
Title: Full-Pixel MALDI-MSI Quantification from MZmine-Aligned Features
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Wessel",
    family = "Alderden",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "WesAld@users.noreply.github.com"
  )
Description: A local R Shiny workflow for extracting feature intensities from
    centroided full-pixel MALDI mass spectrometry imaging data, applying
    within-pixel spectrum-sum normalization, summarizing individual samples or
    biological groups, integrating putative MZmine annotations, and exporting
    validated workbooks with provenance and quality-control records.
